```

This mutation caches the goal distance field once per turn in an `update()` keep, instead of recomputing `field(goals())` on every pass of the loop. The fuel saving should be large because `goals()` and `field()` are engine calls. The trade-off is that the field can be a few actions stale within a turn, for example after a champion moves or a camp is cleared.

